  "summary": "Milas carpets and rugs (also  Milâs or Melas) are Turkish carpets and rugs  that bear characteristics proper to the district of Milas in Muğla Province in southwestern Turkey.",
  "description": "Milas carpets and rugs (also  Milâs or Melas) are Turkish carpets and rugs  that bear characteristics proper to the district of Milas in Muğla Province in southwestern Turkey. There are also a number of variants within the definition of Milas carpets. These variants are called under such names as Ada Milas, Patlıcanlı, Cıngıllı Cafer, Gemisuyu, and Elikoynunda, depending on the style, colors and other characteristics.",
